WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,740
It's amazing when you lie down. What's this called?

2
00:00:03,060 --> 00:00:04,060
Internally divided corpse strips

3
00:00:04,620 --> 00:00:06,020
This place smells like trust water

4
00:00:06,580 --> 00:00:09,060
You might find something useful. Look over there.

5
00:00:29,220 --> 00:00:30,220
This is not the earth

6
00:00:30,770 --> 00:00:31,810
There is no ground below

7
00:00:32,330 --> 00:00:38,540
There are no buildings outside. We can't get out. It's not the earth. It's not the earth.

8
00:00:40,020 --> 00:00:41,020
This light is scattered

9
00:00:41,260 --> 00:00:42,220
Not direct sunlight

10
00:00:43,240 --> 00:00:47,510
It's more like something coming out of the clouds

11
00:00:48,620 --> 00:00:49,740
You have to know one thing

12
00:00:51,470 --> 00:00:59,300
It doesn't matter that we haven't been on Earth all this time.

13
00:00:59,950 --> 00:01:01,230
At least there's sunshine here
